{
  "title": "Record for \"From cells to councils: a conservation law of allocation under scarcity\"",
  "description": "The record behind the paper \"From cells to councils: a conservation law of allocation under scarcity\" (SSRN preprint, doi:10.2139/ssrn.7579199): the paper and its supplement as posted, with the PDF; the Persistence Allocation Model (current version, and the versions the held-out tests were derived from; earlier versions are in the commit history); derived propositions with a numerical check; literature searches; natural-system checks; and two pre-registered held-out tests (H1, VitalDB; PT1, English local government) with their pre-registrations, analysis code, results, replications and blind adjudications. Extracted from the author's working repository with commit history and dates preserved; see README.md.",
